              NodeWork
            </h3>
            <span
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-coral/35 bg-coral/[0.08] px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[0.65rem] font-medium uppercase leading-[1.4] tracking-[0.06em] text-coral-soft"
